    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Why GitOps",
      "items": [
        "Git is the single source of truth for what runs",
        "CI never touches the cluster; Argo CD pulls changes in",
        "Rollback = git revert, Argo CD syncs the old SHA back"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Security gates",
      "items": [
        "OIDC gives CI short-lived AWS credentials, no access keys in GitHub",
        "Trivy blocks images with known critical vulnerabilities"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Infrastructure pipeline",
      "items": [
        "Terraform PRs run fmt, validate, tflint, checkov, then plan",
        "Plan output is reviewed in the PR before anyone applies it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "After rollout",
      "items": [
